  "body": "Check the record length in SubscriptionWrapperSerde.deserialize against\nthe fixed header (version and instruction bytes, the optional 16-byte\nhash and the 4-byte primary partition for version 1) before reading it,\nand reject unknown versions before parsing. A truncated record now\nthrows a SerializationException instead of a NegativeArraySizeException\nor BufferUnderflowException.\n\nAdded unit tests in SubscriptionWrapperSerdeTest.\n",
