     "name": "Aashish Kumar",
     "email": "aaskumar@confluent.io",
     "date": "2026-10-28T11:39:17Z"
    },
    "message": "MINOR: improve SubscriptionWrapperSerde\n\nSubscriptionWrapperSerde.deserialize computes the primary key length from the\nrecord size without checking that the record is long enough, so a truncated\nrecord fails with NegativeArraySizeException or BufferUnderflowException.\n\nCheck the record length against the fixed header (2 bytes, optional 16-byte\nhash, 4-byte partition for version 1) before reading, and reject unknown\nversions before parsing, so these cases fail with a clear\nSerializationException / UnsupportedVersionException instead.",
